I've had a terrible series of games recently and thought some of you might
like a laugh at my expense. Here are some typical entries from the recent
log book of Raen-V:

Game 1:

Find +4 splint mail and other armour by level 2 and a scroll of enchant armour.
Remove armour, read scroll. Arrrrgh, removed wrong one. Splint mail
evaporates. AC goes -7 => +3. Death awaits.

Game 2:

In gnomish mines. Find lots of nice gems. Apply bag of holding. Aaaargh, that
was the bag of tricks. Wide open space becomes wide full space. Game Over.

Game 3:

Drop valuable scroll on dart trap. Go to pick it up. Oh shit, I haven't got
poison resistance this game yet. Die again.

Game 4:

Get Mjollnir and some good armour, go round mines stomping things. See a
rothe approaching and decide to take the other monster out first. 'The mumak
butts'. Guess what.

Game 5:

Find loads of armour, except it turned out to be cursed gloves of fumbling, 
cursed boots of fumbling, cursed -2 splint mail, cursed -1 elven cloak and
cursed -1 orcish helm. Call these random numbers?

I love nethack, esp the bit at the end 'You were extremely lucky'.

Martin

